DESCRIPTION:National Cake Day falls on November 26\, and nobody appears to 
 have asked for it: no bakery trade group\, manufacturer\, agency or news o
 utlet claims the day\, and no source explains the date. The subject is stu
 rdier than the observance. Cake as Americans now bake it — tall\, soft\,
  sweet and reliably repeatable — depends on two pieces of industrial che
 mistry that are younger than the country\, and both are well documented.\n
 \nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-cake-day/
